<%# Every stream surface that empties out uses the same centred shape the client
    already uses elsewhere - a glyph over a heading and a line naming what will
    fill it - rather than a bare sentence sitting in a list row, which reads as
    a row that failed to render. Locals: `glyph`, `heading`, `note`. %>
<div class="empty-state">
  <span class="empty-state-icon" aria-hidden="true"><%= icon(glyph) %></span>
  <h2><%= heading %></h2>
  <p><%= note %></p>
</div>
